sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Emitter
  participant Driver
  participant Dispatcher
  participant Handler
  App->>Emitter: emit message
  Emitter->>Driver: send
  Note over Driver: Web request returns
  Dispatcher->>Driver: wait blocks
  Driver-->>Dispatcher: one message
  Dispatcher->>Handler: handle
  Handler-->>Dispatcher: true, false, or throw
